# Copy to .dev.vars (never commit .dev.vars).
#
# You usually need NOTHING here. The `ai` binding in wrangler.jsonc reaches
# OpenAI models through AI Gateway Unified Billing — Cloudflare holds the
# provider credentials, so there is no API key to manage. It needs prepaid
# AI Gateway credits on the account.
#
# Optional: pick the model. Accepts "openai/gpt-5.5" or a bare "gpt-5.5".
# OPENAI_MODEL=openai/gpt-5.5
#
# Optional: route through a named gateway instead of the default one.
# AI_GATEWAY_ID=default
#
# Fallback only, for a deploy with no AI binding or no gateway credits.
# The key stays on the Durable Object; it never reaches the page.
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
